        "end": 347,
        "quote": "In an in vitro study, COS-7 cells expressing KIT S628N activating mutation demonstrated sensitivity to imatinib and dasatinib treatments when compared to the KIT L576P, which was used as an imatinib-sensitive control. Sensitivity was determined by assessing reduced mutant KIT auto-phosphorylation via western blotting with addition of inhibitors."
